<title>FINLAND: Metra 4-mth profit, net sales by division.</title>
<headline>Metra 4-mth profit, net sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish diversified engineering group Metra Oy Ab on Wednesday gave the following breakdown of its January-April results (million markka unless stated):</p>
<p>    OPERATING PROFIT:  Jan-April '97    Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Wartsila Diesel	   -120		  -64</p>
<p> Sanitec			138		  100</p>
<p> Imatra Steel		  45		   55</p>
<p> Other operations	    50		   22</p>
<p> TOTAL Group		  113		  113</p>
<p>    NET SALES:	   Jan-April '97    Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Wartisila Diesel	  2,637		1,851</p>
<p> Sanitec			 986		  871</p>
<p> Imatra Steel		  355		  358</p>
<p> Other operations	     22		  100</p>
<p> Intra-group		   -15		  -18</p>
<p> TOTAL Group		 3,985		3,162</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@reuter.fi</p>
</text>
